OL,3,ANew Mandelson papers reveal government
OL,4,Aconcerns over his shares in lobbying
OL,5,Afirm
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe government has published more
OL,8,Fdocuments on the appointment of Lord
OL,9,FMandelson as US ambassador - we're
OL,10,Fgoing through them now
OL,12,FThey show that senior officials were
OL,13,Fconcerned about potential conflicts of
OL,14,Finterest from Lord Mandelson's
OL,15,Fshareholding in Global Counsel, a
OL,16,Flobbying firm he co-founded in 2010
OL,18,FIn one exchange, a civil servant asks
OL,19,Fhow "blind" his shareholding could be,
OL,20,Fas Mandelson "would know that he
OL,21,Fcontinued to hold the equity"
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
